# Anthotype Studio backend configuration.
# Copy to `.env` and fill in.  `.env` is gitignored.

# ---- vision LLM (extracts the page copy + boxes from the design) -----------
# provider: openai (any OpenAI-compatible endpoint) | anthropic | stub
# `stub` needs no key and produces an art-only page -- useful for testing the
# pipeline end to end without a model.
VISION_PROVIDER=openai
VISION_MODEL=
VISION_API_KEY=
VISION_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1

# ---- local AntSeed proxy (recommended on this machine) ---------------------
# AntSeed VPR exposes an OpenAI-compatible marketplace on 127.0.0.1:8377.
# `glm-5.3-flash` is the recommended vision model here: it transcribes the
# mockup exactly and returns accurate boxes (8/8 blocks, ~0.72 mean box IoU on
# the light reference), free on the peer it routes to.
#
#   VISION_PROVIDER=openai
#   VISION_MODEL=glm-5.3-flash
#   VISION_API_KEY=antseed-local
#   VISION_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8377/v1
#
# P2P routing is not always reliable: the chosen peer may not serve the model,
# be offline, or be out of credit.  VISION_FALLBACK_MODELS is a comma-separated
# list tried in order when the configured model fails, so one bad peer cannot
# fail a build.  Pick different *models* -- retrying the same one often lands on
# the same peer.
#
#   VISION_FALLBACK_MODELS=deepseek-v4-1-flash,gpt-5.6-luna
#
# Check it is up:  curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8377/v1/models | head -c 200

# ---- optional overrides ----------------------------------------------------
# CHROME=/Applications/Google Chrome.app/Contents/MacOS/Google Chrome
# NODE=/path/to/node
# STUDIO_TIMEOUT_TRACE=1800
# STUDIO_TIMEOUT_BUILD=900
